# Turn to Frog's "loses all abilities" is a layer-6 effect at its timestamp (CR 613.1f, 613.7): it takes what the creature
# has when it applies, an ability gained earlier included, and not one gained later (the ruling: "If the affected creature
# gains an ability after Turn to Frog resolves, it will keep that ability"). On turn 3 Bot1's Llanowar Elves gets Blossoming
# Defense's +2/+2 and hexproof and then Turn to Frog: no hexproof, a 3/3 (base 1/1, +2/+2 in 7c). On turn 4 Bot2's Elves
# gets Turn to Frog first and Blossoming Defense after it: hexproof kept, a 3/3 too.

